[2025-10-20T18:21:27Z INFO  ai_agent_audit::llm_review::phases::add_poc_findings] AI Agent: This PoC demonstrates how rounding errors in the 80/20 split calculation can permanently lock protocol fees. When the total amount collected isn't divisible by 5, integer division creates dust that remains in the contract but isn't accounted for in totalFees. The test shows that with an entrance fee of 1 wei and 4 players (total 4 wei), the prize calculation results in 3 wei (80% of 4) and 0 wei for fees (20% of 4), leaving 1 wei of dust in the contract. Since withdrawFees() requires address(this).balance == totalFees, this dust permanently prevents fee withdrawal. The test further demonstrates that this issue compounds with each raffle, making the protocol fees increasingly locked.
